  "details": "people that use vive , they have a touchpad and this touchpad most of the time (only in vrchat) bug and the game thinks you are still touching the touchpad even so your not, this mean that you will have trouble either turning left and right or moving around , I'm guessing depending how your team will implement playmaker script it might fix it.\n\nSo if for now you could give us in the system menu a debugging tools when the vive controller bug happen, pretty much disabling the touchpad and renable it\n\nand if you could give us in the menu a option so you could go in view mode so you can see your own avatar and stuff around you in a limited box so we can't go to far. that would be awesome for creator like me.\n\nRyuu",
